{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283240","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028324001:1":{"text":"이 레시피는...\n자네들... 이걸 마시고 잠에서 안 깨는 사람이 생긴 건가?","source_cn":"这个药方是……\\n你们几个……是不是有人喝了它之后沉睡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0118E0650FD6E745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028324002:1":{"text":"네. 혹시... 이 묘약에 대해 알고 계시나요?","source_cn":"是的。您……您知道这种灵药？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECA3B57BC09A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028324003:1":{"text":"아이고. 전에 식물 위치를 물어봤을 때 아무거나 막 먹으면 안 된다고 하지 않았는가.","source_cn":"唉，之前你们问过一些草药的生长位置，那会儿我就说了不要乱喝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AB62BA468AF5E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028324004:0":{"text":"이 약초들을 배합해서 마시면 의식을 잃고 깊은 잠에 빠지게 된다네. 다시 깨어나려면 특별한 스멜링솔트가 필요하지.","source_cn":"这些草药组合起来能让人失去意识，彻底沉眠，只有一种特殊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B20B7ADEC31D458","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028324005:1":{"text":"그 스멜링솔트를 만드실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"您能制作这种嗅盐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA391799746870CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028324006:1":{"text":"물론이지. 다만, 스멜링솔트를 만들려면 “황금꿀”이라는 재료가 반드시 있어야 하는데...","source_cn":"当然可以。不过，制作嗅盐的其中一种主材料叫“黄金蜂蜜”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4F27CD76C578FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028324007:1":{"text":"허니리프베어가 애지중지하는 물건이라 찾기 굉장히 어려울 거야. 나는 이미 늙을 대로 늙어서 직접 황금꿀을 찾으러 갈 수 없다네.","source_cn":"那东西很少见，叶角熊把它当宝贝。我这老胳膊老腿的，怕是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2947FEA79BDD6FB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028324008:1":{"text":"그런 건 저희한테 맡겨주세요. 어르신께서는 스멜링솔트만 만들어 주시면 돼요!","source_cn":"跑腿的事情交给我们，一会儿制作嗅盐就麻烦您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFE6ED02F75E783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝茶的老者":{"text":"차를 마시고 있는 노인","source":"喝茶的老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}